#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1496
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Function Wrapper</guimenuitem> — Selecting an item from the "
"submenu shown in <xref linkend=\"menu-insert-fw.png\"/> replaces every "
"rectangular region in the current selection with an array function in which "
"the appropriate function is wrapped around an array version of the current "
"content. This can be used to create a self-sorting data region."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Tillämpa funktion</guimenuitem> — När du väljer ett alternativ "
"i undermenyn som visas i <xref linkend=\"menu-insert-fw.png\"/> ersätts "
"varje rektangulärt område i markeringen med en matrisfunktion som tillämpar "
"den valda funktionen på innehållet. På så sätt kan du skapa ett dataområde "
"som sorterar sig självt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1504
msgid "The <guimenu>Function Wrapper</guimenu> submenu."
msgstr "Undermenyn <guimenu>Tillämpa funktion</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1506
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-insert-fw.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Function Wrapper "
"submenu.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-insert-fw.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av undermenyn Tillämpa "
"funktion.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1519
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Name...</guimenuitem> opens a dialog with a list of all defined"
" names that can be pasted into the current cell. The dialog is similar to "
"the <guimenu>Define Names</guimenu> dialog opened by choosing "
"<guimenuitem>Modify ▶ Names...</guimenuitem> from the <xref linkend=\"Edit-"
"Menu\"/>. See <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-names\"/> for details."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Namn…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta med en lista över alla"
" definierade namn som kan klistras in i den aktuella cellen. Dialogrutan "
"liknar <guimenu>Definiera namn</guimenu>, som du öppnar genom att välja "
"<guimenuitem>Ändra ▶ Namn…</guimenuitem> på menyn <xref linkend=\"Edit-"
"Menu\"/>. Mer information finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-formulas-"
"names\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1531
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Comment...</guimenuitem> opens a dialog where you can enter or "
"edit a comment for the active cell. The dialog is described in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-data-comment\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Kommentar…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta där du kan skriva"
" eller redigera en kommentar för den aktiva cellen. Dialogrutan beskrivs i "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-data-comment\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1539
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Hyperlink...</guimenuitem> opens a dialog for entering the "
"location of a link. The dialog is described in <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"link\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Hyperlänk…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta där du anger en "
"länkadress. Dialogrutan beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-link\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1546
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Special</guimenuitem> opens a submenu from which you can insert"
" predefined content into a cell. You can insert the current date, the "
"current time, or both."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Special</guimenuitem> öppnar en undermeny där du kan infoga "
"fördefinierat innehåll i en cell. Du kan infoga dagens datum, aktuell tid "
"eller båda."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1577
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Format</guimenu> menu allows users to control the formats of "
"cells, columns, rows, worksheets and the workbook. This menu also gives "
"users access to templates of standard formats."
msgstr ""
"På menyn <guimenu>Format</guimenu> kan du styra formateringen av celler, "
"kolumner, rader, kalkylblad och arbetsboken. Menyn ger också tillgång till "
"mallar med standardformat."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1585
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Format</guimenu> Menu and Its <guimenu>Cells</guimenu> Submenu."
msgstr ""
"Menyn <guimenu>Format</guimenu> och undermenyn <guimenu>Celler</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1588
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-format-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Format menu and its "
"Cells submenu.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-format-labelled.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av menyn Format och dess "
"undermeny Celler.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1602
msgid "<guimenu>The Format Menu</guimenu> offers these menuitems:"
msgstr "<guimenu>Menyn Format</guimenu> innehåller följande menyobjekt:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1609
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Cells</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Cells...</guimenuitem> "
"menu item opens a submenu with choices to allows the user to modify the "
"formatting of the selected cells."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Celler</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Celler…</guimenuitem> öppnar en undermeny med alternativ för "
"att ändra formateringen av de markerade cellerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1619
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Format...</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Format...</guimenuitem> menu item opens the cell format dialog."
" This dialog is used to set cell data types and formats. It is explained in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-data-format\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Formatera…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Formatera…</guimenuitem> öppnar dialogrutan för "
"cellformatering. Där anger du cellernas datatyper och format. Dialogrutan "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-format\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1628
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Conditional Formatting...</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Conditional Formatting...</guimenuitem> menu item opens the "
"conditional format dialog. This dialog is used to set cell data types and "
"formats that depend on values in the workbook. It is explained in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-data-format-conditional\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Villkorlig formatering…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Villkorlig formatering…</guimenuitem> öppnar dialogrutan för "
"villkorlig formatering. Där anger du cellernas datatyper och format utifrån "
"värden i arbetsboken. Dialogrutan beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-data-"
"format-conditional\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1639
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Merge</guimenuitem> — This menu item combines the current "
"selection into a single large cell."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Sammanfoga</guimenuitem> — Det här menyobjektet sammanfogar den"
" aktuella markeringen till en enda stor cell."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1646
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Unmerge</guimenuitem> — This menu item divides a merged "
"selection into the original cells."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Ångra sammanfogning</guimenuitem> — Det här menyobjektet delar "
"upp en sammanfogad markering i de ursprungliga cellerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1653
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Auto Fit Height</guimenuitem> — This menu item makes "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatically choose the optimal row "
"heights to display all of the text in the current selection."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Autoanpassa höjd</guimenuitem> — Det här menyobjektet låter "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt välja radhöjder så att all "
"text i den aktuella markeringen visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1661
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Auto Fit Width</guimenuitem> — This menu item makes "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatically choose the optimal column "
"widths to display all of the text in the current selection."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Autoanpassa bredd</guimenuitem> — Det här menyobjektet låter "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt välja kolumnbredder så att "
"all text i den aktuella markeringen visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1673
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Column</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Column</guimenuitem> "
"menu item opens a submenu with choices to allows the user to modify the view"
" of the selected columns."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Kolumn</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Kolumn</guimenuitem> öppnar en undermeny med alternativ för att"
" ändra visningen av de markerade kolumnerna."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1681
msgid "The <guimenu>Column</guimenu> Submenu."
msgstr "Undermenyn <guimenu>Kolumn</guimenu>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1683
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-format-column.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of the Column submenu.</phrase>"
" </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/menu-format-column.png\"/> "
"</imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>En bild av undermenyn Kolumn.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1697
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Width...</guimenuitem> — The "
"<guimenuitem>Width...</guimenuitem> menu item opens a dialog to enable the "
"user to adjust the size of the columns which hold the current selection. The"
" dialog has a single entry box in which the user can change the current size"
" of the column in points."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Bredd…</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Bredd…</guimenuitem> öppnar en dialogruta där du kan ändra "
"bredden på kolumnerna med markerade celler. Dialogrutan har ett "
"inmatningsfält där du anger kolumnbredden i punkter."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1707
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Auto Fit Width</guimenuitem> — This menu item makes "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatically choose the optimal column "
"size to display all of the text in the current selection."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Autoanpassa bredd</guimenuitem> — Det här menyobjektet låter "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> automatiskt välja en kolumnbredd så att "
"all text i den aktuella markeringen visas."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1715
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Hide</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Hide</guimenuitem> menu "
"item will hide the columns containing the current selection. "
"<application>Gnumeric</application> still holds these columns in memory and "
"will save them to a file but will not display those columns. The only "
"indication that a user has that columns have been hidden is that the column "
"header names are not sequential."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Dölj</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Dölj</guimenuitem> döljer kolumnerna med de markerade cellerna."
" <application>Gnumeric</application> behåller kolumnerna i minnet och sparar"
" dem i filen, men visar dem inte. Det enda tecknet på att kolumner har dolts"
" är att kolumnrubrikerna inte följer i ordning."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1773
msgid ""
"<guimenuitem>Hide</guimenuitem> — The <guimenuitem>Hide</guimenuitem> menu "
"item will hide the rows in the selection. The workbook still contains the "
"data in the hidden rows but those rows are not shown."
msgstr ""
"<guimenuitem>Dölj</guimenuitem> — Menyobjektet "
"<guimenuitem>Dölj</guimenuitem> döljer raderna i markeringen. Arbetsboken "
"innehåller fortfarande data i de dolda raderna, men de visas inte."
